    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ikūjo kūshoka mu hekalu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū munhū ng'wenūyo ūnenha kū mita ūyo gwalī gūlolelile kīya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nūlībona ī likūjo lya ng'wa Mulungu wa Isilaeli līliza kūfumīīla mu kīya. Ī lilaka lyakwe lyalī gītī ng'huutumo gwa minzī mingī gakūhūūmaga; ī sī yang'wekaga kūlwa nguno y'ikūjo lyakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū koolechiwa ūko nakakūbona kwalī gīt'ū koolechiwa ūyo naalī naagūbona aho akiza kūgūkenaagūla ū nzengo; gītī ī shakoolechiwa īsho naalī nashibona kū Mongo gwa Kebali, nūgwa hasī nabundaalile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī likūjo lya ng'wa SEEBA lingīla ū mu hekalu, lyūbītīla ha mita ūyo gūlolelile kīya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Moyo o ng'wa Seeba ūnibūūcha ūnenha mu gwalugwa ya mu gatī, ī likūjo lya ng'wa Seeba lyokala pa ū mu hekalu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū munhū ng'wenūyo aho ataalī īmīīlile hamò nū nene, kwimanīla nigwa ilaka lya munhū līlīniyombya kūfuma ū mu hekalu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūniwīla, “Ng'wana wa munhū, ī lipandī lyenīlī h'ī lisumbī lyane lya būtemi, hama hū būtūūlo bo mhamabala jane. H'ī lipandī īlo nakwikala mo nalī hamò nabo a Baisilaeli. A ba numba ya Isilaeli batalalīsosohaja hangī ī lina lyane lyeela mu nzīla ya būmalahya wabo; a boi benekīlī nūūlū a batemi babo, batalagatūmamīla hangī a mapandī gabo ga higūlya, nūūlū ī shiikolile sha kūlamiwa sha batemi babo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho baagwiheja ū nyango gwabo nū gwane, ī ng'hīngī ja ha nyango gwabo jūtandaala nī jane, shūlekanyiwa ndugu dūhū; bakalīsosohaja ī lina lyane na mashītīle gabo ga malofu. H'ī chene nakabakenaagūla kūlwa kūnipelanya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī haha lūūlū ni bawīnjage ū būmalahya wabo ū kū būtongi wane, pyī nī shiikolile sha kūlamiwa sha batemi babo, a henaho hū nakwikala hamò nabo welelo bose.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bebe ng'wana wa munhū, a banhū ba Isilaeli basomboolelage ūmo īlī ī hekalu, bagooke kūlwa shibi shabo. Ni bīyiganikage ūmo īlī; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ūlū būgooka kūlwa yose īyo bīyīta, ūkūbalanja ī hekalu ūmò īlī; ūmo īhelelilwe, nī milyango yayo ya kūfumīla na kwingīlīla; pye ūmo īlī gete na a kaīle kaamo nī shilagīlo. Ī mihayo yenīyī yandīkage mu būtongi wabo balolile, bīdiime ūmo īlī gete, bayūlondeela akajīle kaamo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alilūūlū, ī shilagīlo sha hekalu shiishi: Pyī ī libbaala lya higūlya ya lūgūlū īlo lyīpīndīlīgije ī hekalu līkūbiza lyeela no no no. Ī shenīsho h'ī shilagīlo sha hekalu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ng'walīlò ūmo gwaalī",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Īshi h'ī shipimo sha ng'walīlò, mu kapimīle ako kaatūmamīlagwa makanza genayo. Ī shidako būgūngūhu wa nusu miita nū būshimu nusu miita, a higūlya kabize ho kakīgījo ka sentimita makūmi abīlī n'ibīlī. Ū wenūbū hū ū būgūngūhu wago ū ng'walīlò. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Miita īmò ū kwīnga a hasī a higūlya ya ngoka kwiza h'ikīgījo lya ha sīlīlī, ū būgalī galī nusu miita. Ū kwīnga a h'ikīgījo ī lido kwiza h'ikīgījo ī litaale miita ibīlī, ū būgalī galī nusu miita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī lipandī lya ng'walīlò a ha kūpembela moto gwa shitambò līkūbiza na būgūngūhu bo miita ibīlī, na gūkūbiza na mapembe anè gasongile kūja igūlya kwīnga a ha bookejo bo shitambò. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A higūlya ya ng'walīlò a ha kūpembela moto gwa shitambò hakūbiza na shipimo sha miita itandatū ū būlīhu nū būgalī galī miita itandatū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī likīgījo lya higūlya nalyo līkūbiza na shipimo sha būlenganīle, ū būlīhū miitī mpungatī nū būgalī galī miitī mpungatī, na lūgala lo sentimita makūmi abīlī n'itanò kūlīpīndīlīja ī lyose. Ī ngaji ja kūlinhīla a ha ng'walīlo jikūbiza kū lwandī lwa kīya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūniwīla, “Ng'wana wa munhū, ū Seeba MULUNGU alīhaya gīkī, Aka h'a kaīle ka kafunīje ka shitambò sha kūpemvwa na kūseeseebela mininga ha ng'walīlo ūlū gūlazengwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bagabīji ba lūganda lo Lawī, a balekwa Sadoki, abo bakegeelaga kū būtongi bone kūnitūmamīla, ūkūbinha nzagamba songi ya kūfunya shitambò kūlwa shibi; alīhaya Seeba MULUNGU. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūkūsola mininga gayo gamò ūgabile a ha mapembe ja ng'walīlo būnè waago, na a higūlya ya mhembeelo j'ikīgījo būnè wajo, nū lūgala ū lose; ū mu gīko ūkūgweja ū ng'walīlo na kūgūbeegeja isangī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ī nzagamba ya shitambò sha kweja shibi ūkwīsola ūkīpembe mu moto kwipandī īlo līsolilwe, hanze y'ipandī lyeela.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A ha ntondo yaho ūkūfunya ngulyati songi ītī na shilingo, ībize shitambò sha kweja shibi, nū ng'walīlo gūkwejiwa gīt'ūmo gūleegejiwe mu nzīla ya nzagamba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū ūmala ū kūgweja, ūkūsola nzagamba songi na ng'ondi kwīnga ū ng'widaale ūjifunye, ī jose jitī na shilingo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 43:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūkūjitūūla kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA, hūna a bagabīji bakūjimemeleja munhu, hanuma bajifunye kūbiza shitambò sha kūpemvwa kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
